OL,3,GNEWSACould closing Aberdeen strip clubs
OL,4,Abring new dangers for dancers?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We have the power to say no here,"
OL,7,Fsays strip club dancer 'Amy'.
OL,9,FNot her real name, Amy fears that steps
OL,10,Fthat could phase out strip clubs in
OL,11,FAberdeen will move the industry
OL,12,Funderground and make it unsafe for
OL,13,Fthose who work in it.
OL,15,FThe city council agreed earlier this
OL,16,Fmonth to adopt a "presumption against"
OL,17,Fgranting new licences, including for
OL,18,Fany replacement of an existing site
OL,19,Fshould it close in the future.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
