OL,3,GNEWSACould closing Aberdeen strip clubs
OL,4,Abring new dangers for dancers?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmy, who is in her early 30s, told BBC
OL,7,FScotland News she believed that if the
OL,8,Fclubs eventually close, it could become
OL,9,Fdangerous for the dancers.
